      "review_description": "On the day of installation, our chosen 275 watt PV panels had not arrived, so Solarkraft upgraded us to more efficient 285 watt panels. Similarly, as we have a three-phase installation, they upgraded the inverter to an ABB 8.5 kW \"trio\" three-phase model.Sparkies arrived on time as promised and the whole installation was completed in one day, with commissioning on the following say -a Saturday-.Lewis ran me through the entire operating procedure on the Saturday as well as indicating where all the safety labels were located. Good job!All I need to do now is to be able to contact Origin in a timely manner.... long delays on the phone, internet link as given on the voice announcement is broken, I found it by doing a search, then as I tried to log in, an announcement popped that I didn't enter my details fast enough, so, as we write we're still on the starting blocks...",
